    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d242">

                <pb facs="0380" n="208" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg208"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72111Y2/4</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in Germany</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Gerard</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-01-22T16:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 22, 1917, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3809. Your 4909, January 19, 7 p.m. Please telegraph immediately whether there
                    are any American citizens among prisoners brought to Swinemünde by the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Yarrowdale</hi>. If so, their names and American
                    addresses.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
